<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage at 9.592 bln rand Wed.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage at 9.592 bln rand Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage rose to 9.592 billion rand on Wednesday from 8.496 billion rand on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
